  "title": "They Liked You More Than You Think #shorts",
  "description": "Mae's inner Critic replays every word of a five-minute chat with her new neighbour. Research says the Critic is wrong: in Boothby, Cooney, Sandstrom & Clark's 2018 studies (Psychological Science), people who had just talked with a stranger consistently underestimated how much their partner liked them, and shyer people underestimated more. They called it the liking gap. #psychology #shorts #socialanxiety",
